---
const value = 'White and Beige';
const selectionStart = 9;
const cells = [...value].map((char, index) => ({ char: char === ' ' ? '␣' : char, index }));
---

<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="caret-layer" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="panel">
      <header>
        <span class="eyebrow">.shared-properties form::before</span>
        <strong>A caret for inputs that never have focus</strong>
      </header>

      <div class="ruler">
        <div class="cells">
          {cells.map((cell) => (
            <span class:list={['cell', { before: cell.index < selectionStart }]}>
              <span class="char">{cell.char}</span>
              <span class="index">{cell.index}</span>
            </span>
          ))}
          <span class="caret" style={{ '--caret': selectionStart }}></span>
        </div>
        <div class="readout">
          <span><code>selectionStart</code> = <strong>{selectionStart}</strong></span>
          <span>→</span>
          <span><code>--caret: {selectionStart}</code></span>
          <span>→</span>
          <span><code>left: min(var(--caret) * 1ch, var(--input-width) - 1ch)</code></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span class="n">1</span>
          <span>The shared input's <code>keyup</code>, <code>focus</code>, <code>click</code> and <code>blur</code> read <code>selectionStart</code>, clamped to the last space before it, since a space counts twice</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n">2</span>
          <span>Each style form gets <code>--caret</code> and its input's <code>--input-width</code>; the value is copied in and scrolled to its end</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n">3</span>
          <span>The form is monospace, so <code>1ch</code> is one character and a <code>::before</code> holding a literal <code>|</code> lands where the real caret would</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="n">4</span>
          <span>It only paints while the shared input <code>:focus</code> holds, blinks with <code>opacity</code> keyframes, and stands still under <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code></span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
.wrapper {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: max-content;
  max-width: min(92cqw, 100%);
  margin-inline: auto;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}

.caret-layer {
  width: max-content;
  max-width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--font-poppins), system-ui, sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 0.023 * min(var(--sheet-inline), var(--sheet-block)), 1rem);
  color: var(--ink);

  :global([data-sheet-orientation='portrait']) & {
    font-size: min(1rem, 0.023 * min(var(--sheet-inline), var(--sheet-block)));
  }
}

.panel {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  max-width: 100%;
  padding: 0.75em 0.875em;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 0.5em;
  background: var(--surface-raised);
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.625em;
}

header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.125em;

  strong {
    font-size: 0.875em;
  }
}

.eyebrow {
  font-family: monospace, system-ui;
  font-size: 0.625em;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-muted);
}

.ruler {
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.5em;
  padding: 0.5em 0.625em;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 0.375em;
  background: var(--surface-sunken);
}

.cells {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  width: max-content;
  font-family: monospace, system-ui;
  font-size: 1.25em;
}

.cell {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 1ch;

  .char {
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .index {
    font-size: 0.5em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  &.before .char {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  &:not(.before) .char {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
}

.caret {
  position: absolute;
  left: calc(var(--caret) * 1ch);
  top: 0;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1.25em;
  background: var(--accent);
  animation: caret-blink 500ms infinite alternate both;
}

.readout {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.375em;
  font-size: 0.6875em;
  color: var(--ink-muted);

  strong {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
}

.steps {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
  display: grid;
  gap: 0.375em;
  max-width: 44em;

  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25em minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5em;
    align-items: start;
    font-size: 0.6875em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .n {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 1.25em;
    height: 1.25em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    font-family: monospace, system-ui;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
}

code {
  font-family: monospace, system-ui;
}

@keyframes caret-blink {
  from, 49% {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  50%, to {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .caret {
    animation: none;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
}
</style>
